From 03cf302532ff2ab7d1102997f81135553d3ca9cb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Test <test@test.com>
Date: Thu, 20 Aug 2026 23:12:01 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] Connect shop page to Products collection

- Products collection: add Accessories category, featured (Hot Deals)
  checkbox, switch image field from upload to plain text URL (Vercel's
  serverless filesystem can't keep uploaded files)
- Shop page: fetch live products from Payload instead of the old
  hardcoded SHOP_PRODUCTS list, via Payload's Local API
- ShopGrid: read products from props, show a Hot Deals section for
  featured items, and show a WhatsApp quote button instead of Add to
  Cart for quote-only items
- Commit the config split (payload.config.mjs + payload.config.js
  shim) and the first migration, which were only ever applied by hand
  before - now tracked in git so the repo matches the live database
